# PARKED, not abandoned. GitHub refuses a workflow file from an OAuth token
# without the `workflow` scope, and that rejection blocks the whole push.
# The file is written and ready at .github/workflows/deploy.yml. To land it:
#   gh auth refresh -h github.com -u itayme26 -s workflow
# then delete these three lines and commit .github/ normally.
.github/
